<h1>The cascade spectrum - what each approach needs to work</h1>
<table class="fig">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Approach</th>
<th>Decision mechanism</th>
<th>Training / data needed</th>
<th>Weak point</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><div>Always the big model</div>
<div>send everything to GPT-class</div></td>
<td><div>none - always escalate</div>
<div>quality floor by construction</div></td>
<td><div>none</div></td>
<td><div>cost</div>
<div>max price for every token</div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><div>FrugalGPT cascade</div>
<div>arXiv:2305.05176 · up to −98% cost</div></td>
<td><div>learned scorer</div>
<div>g(query, answer) → confidence</div></td>
<td><div>labeled examples required</div>
<div>must match test distribution</div></td>
<td><div>ML project upfront</div>
<div>drift → retraining</div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><div>Trained router (RouteLLM)</div>
<div>arXiv:2406.18665 · preference data</div></td>
<td><div>router model picks per query</div>
<div>before any generation</div></td>
<td><div>preference pairs + router training</div>
<div>strong / weak model pair fixed</div></td>
<td><div>router is the product</div>
<div>wrong pick = no retry signal</div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><div>Entropy gate (ours)</div>
<div>two-phase + mid-stream sliding window</div>
<div>threshold 0.45, tuned per chain</div></td>
<td><div>avg H/log₂(k) over tokens</div>
<div>confident → serve, else discard + re-route</div>
<div>logprobs the API already returns</div></td>
<td><div>none - zero training</div>
<div>zero labeled data, zero extra infra</div>
<div>fail-open on probe error</div></td>
<td><div>uncertainty ≠ correctness</div>
<div>confident wrong answers pass;</div>
<div>escalation pays twice</div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
